The {{Term/Store|Trousers of the Sky||Series, BotW, TotK}} are a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
It can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SS|-}} Link amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain the Trousers of the Sky. They can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The Trousers of the Sky, alongside the [[Cap of the Sky]] and [[Tunic of the Sky]], comprise the [[Hero of the Sky Set]] which resembles Link's outfit from {{SS}}. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set.

